			"dialogs": [
				{
					"id": 60110101,
					"content": "众人聚在一起，分享了两边发生的事与获得的情报…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_BLACK_SCREEN",
					"nextDialogs": [
						60110102
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 60110102,
					"content": "万幸的是，事件危害被控制在了最小程度，只有一些镇民受伤。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						60110103
					],
					"speakerTitle": "菈乌玛"
				},
				{
					"id": 60110103,
					"content": "但如今猎月人获得了完整的形体，而我们依然对他的目的一无所知。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						60110104
					],
					"speakerTitle": "菈乌玛"
				},
				{
					"id": 60110104,
					"content": "听起来，就像是把凶恶的绒翼龙放归野外了。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						60110105
					],
					"speakerTitle": "伊涅芙"
				},
				{
					"id": 60110105,
					"content": "…大家都不熟悉绒翼龙吗？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						60110106
					],
					"speakerTitle": "伊涅芙"
				},
				{
					"id": 60110106,
					"content": "我、我知道，但你的比喻还是太温和了…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						60110107
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 60110107,
					"content": "他说这个世界对他来说都无关紧要，或许他暂时还没有和我们冲突的理由。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						60110108
					],
					"speakerTitle": "奈芙尔"
				},
				{
					"id": 60110108,
					"content": "如果只是来寻仇的话，那我们眼下也无计可施。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						60110109
					],
					"speakerTitle": "奈芙尔"
				},
				{
					"id": 60110109,
					"content": "现在辞职还来得及吗？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						60110110
					],
					"speakerTitle": "雅珂达"
				},
				{
					"id": 60110110,
					"content": "我开玩笑的，开玩笑的，老板！事到如今肯定跑不掉了嘛！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						60110111
					],
					"speakerTitle": "雅珂达"
				},
				{
					"id": 60110111,
					"content": "呜…结果我无比自豪的大炮根本就在帮倒忙啊…哼！我马上就把它拆了！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						60110112,
						60110113
					],
					"speakerTitle": "爱诺"
				},
				{
					"id": 60110112,
					"content": "这不是爱诺的错…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						60110114
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 60110114,
					"content": "是啊，对付普通的狂猎还是能派上用场的，不要灰心啊。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						60110115
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 60110115,
					"content": "菲林斯，之后需要你去执灯人那边走些事后流程。但我已经帮你解释过了，他们不会找你麻烦。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						60110116
					],
					"speakerTitle": "奈芙尔"
				},
				{
					"id": 60110116,
					"content": "#不胜感激。我还听说您帮了{M#他}{F#她}很多忙，不然我们也没那么容易接触到真相。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						60110117
					],
					"speakerTitle": "菲林斯"
				},
				{
					"id": 60110117,
					"content": "如果你愿意更多展露自己，也不至于落到孤身无援的处境中。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						60110118
					],
					"speakerTitle": "奈芙尔"
				},
				{
					"id": 60110118,
					"content": "呵呵，您的良言我记下了。我会考虑考虑的。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						60110119
					],
					"speakerTitle": "菲林斯"
				},
				{
					"id": 60110119,
					"content": "如果我能接替索西军士长的位置，想必会受益匪浅。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						60110120
					],
					"speakerTitle": "菲林斯"
				},
				{
					"id": 60110120,
					"content": "什么，你要升官了吗？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						60110121
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 60110121,
					"content": "他在开玩笑…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						60110122
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 60110122,
					"content": "这样啊，欸，为什么只有我没有意识到。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						60110123
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 60110123,
					"content": "#{NICKNAME}，如果有空的话，愿意和我来一趟吗？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						60110124
					],
					"speakerTitle": "菲林斯"
				},
				{
					"id": 60110124,
					"content": "我想送那位先生最后一程。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [],
					"speakerTitle": "菲林斯"
				},
				{
					"id": 60110113,
					"content": "也不是大炮的错…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						60110114
					]
				}
			]
		},
		{
